678460":{"__typename":"Group","id":"37678460","name":"T.me/TorontoTantra Circle","urlname":"toronto-tantra-circle","timezone":"America/Toronto","keyGroupPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535840610"},"stats":{"__typename":"GroupStats","eventRatings":{"__typename":"GroupStatsEventRatings","average":5,"totalRatings":13}}},"PhotoInfo:315640847":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"315640847","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/9/f/8/f/highres_315640847.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:339669683":{"__typename":"Member","id":"339669683","name":"Andrii Litvinov","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:315640847"}},"Event:316532830":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316532830","dateTime":"2026-10-02T19:00:00-04:00","isAttending":false,"group":{"__typename":"Group","urlname":"toronto-tantra-circle"}},"Event:316546217":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316546217","dateTime":"2026-10-03T19:00:00-04:00","isAttending":false,"group":{"__typename":"Group","urlname":"toronto-tantra-circle"}},"Event:316560657":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316560657","dateTime":"2026-10-04T19:00:00-04:00","isAttending":false,"group":{"__typename":"Group","urlname":"toronto-tantra-circle"}},"Event:316588148":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316588148","dateTime":"2026-10-06T19:00:00-04:00","isAttending":false,"group":{"__typename":"Group","urlname":"toronto-tantra-circle","__ref":"Group:37678460"},"title":"Tantric Family Constellation: Temple of Love \u0026 Money","description":"**TANTRIC FAMILY CONSTELLATIONS**\n**Tantric Temple Mysteries**\n\n**This is the project overview only.**\n**Themes and dates may change.**\n\n**To find the exact topic, date and register, please join:**\n\n**t.me/TorontoTantra**\n**t.me/AndyTherapist**\n\n**⸻**\n\n**About this event**\n\n**Tantric Family Constellations is a group practice combining Archetypal / Family Constellations with a living tantric Temple space.**\n\n**Each meeting has its own theme.**\n\n**For example:**\n\n**Love \u0026 Money • Ancient Languages of Love • Love \u0026 Loneliness • Masculine \u0026 Feminine • Desire \u0026 Freedom • Relationship Patterns**\n\n**The theme gives us a field to explore — but every participant discovers their own personal story inside it.**\n\n**⸻**\n\n**Part 1 — Discover your pattern**\n\n**We begin by exploring different dimensions of the evening’s theme together.**\n\n**Then each participant goes through a mini-constellation to see their own pattern, model or hidden dynamic.**\n\n**Instead of only thinking about the question, you can see how its different forces are arranged for you:**\n\n**What attracts you?**\n**What do you avoid?**\n**Where does your energy stop?**\n**What are you moving toward?**\n\n**This creates a personal map for the second part of the evening.**\n\n**⸻**\n\n**Part 2 — Enter the Temple**\n\n**Then we open the Tantric Temple.**\n\n**The constellation points become living centers in the space.**\n\n**Participants are free to move between them, following their own inner process.**\n\n**You may stay with one energy, move toward another, step away, return, observe what happens in your body, or allow yourself to gradually absorb a quality that previously felt distant.**\n\n**At the same time, you encounter other participants moving through their own paths.**\n\n**Through presence, movement and consensual interaction, the personal constellation becomes a living group field.**\n\n**There is no fixed choreography and no need to perform.**\n\n**You follow your own rhythm.**\n\n**The practice is about allowing yourself to experience, embody and integrate the different energies of the constellation rather than only understand them intellectually.**\n\n**⸻**\n\n**Why “Temple”?**\n\n**The Temple is a temporary tantric space where symbolic and archetypal energies can be experienced through the body, movement and connection with others.**\n\n**The journey is individual, but it happens inside a shared field.**\n\n**You may discover that a quality which looked abstract during the constellation becomes much more understandable once you can actually move toward it, stay with it and experience it in contact with others.**\n\n**⸻**\n\n**No previous constellation or tantra experience is required.**\n\n**Participation is voluntary, and you can always choose your own level of involvement and contact.**\n\n**The space is based on:**\n\n**consent • respect • confidentiality • personal boundaries • freedom of movement**\n\n**This is a transpersonal personal-growth practice, not a sexual event.**\n\n**Details, themes, dates and registration:**\n**t.me/TorontoTantra**\n\n**Вот более естественный и аккуратный английский вариант, сохраняя твой простой стиль:**\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n1. **Regular Ticket — $100 CAD**\n1. **Early Bird Ticket — $65 CAD**\n**If you register and pay before August 31.**\n**3. Supportive Ticket — $55 CAD**\n**For people with limited financial resources.**\n**4. Bring a Friend — $150 CAD for 2 people**\n\n**If the price is too much for you, send a personal message on Telegram: t.me/AndyTherapist to ask about volunteer options.**\n\n**HOW TO PAY**\n\n**Send an Interac e-Transfer to:**\n**andy.litvinov@gmail.com**\n**After payment, send a screenshot of the confirmation to: t.me/AndyTherapist**\n**Please mention which event you are registering for.**\n\n**After registration, you will be added to the participants’ group.**\n\n**If you have any questions, feel free to message:**\n**t.me/AndyTherapist**\n**Toronto Tantra community:**\n**t.me/TorontoTantra**","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-tantra-circle/events/316588148/","isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535718289"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535718289"},"feeSettings":null,"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":1,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__